5. MULTI-WRITER POLICY — MAKE IT EXPLICIT
=========================================

Review the cross-process policy around automatic reorg depth.

Current sequence is:

  calculate ancestor/depth
  Store.Tip() recheck
  Store.RollbackTo()

The Tip recheck is not atomic with RollbackTo's internal FOR UPDATE lock.

Another writer could theoretically change the tip between those two calls,
meaning RollbackTo could disconnect a different number of blocks from the
depth that was approved.

Do NOT redesign Store silently.

Choose and document one of these policies:

A. Phase 2C.2 production supports exactly ONE active indexer orchestrator
